    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Conversation verisini al\nlet conversation;\ntry {\n  conversation = $json.conversation || [];\n  if (!Array.isArray(conversation)) {\n    console.log('Uyarı: conversation bir array değil');\n    conversation = [];\n  }\n} catch (error) {\n  console.log('Hata:', error.message);\n  conversation = [];\n}\n\n// Prompt oluştur\nconst prompt = `\nYou are a call center conversation analyzer.\n\nBelow is a JSON array called \\`conversation\\`, where each item represents a speech block with the following structure:\n{\n  \"speaker\": \"speaker_0\" or \"speaker_1\",\n  \"text\": \"spoken words\",\n  \"start\": float (start time in seconds),\n  \"end\": float (end time in seconds),\n  \"conversation_index\": integer (order of conversation)\n}\n\nYour task is to analyze this conversation based on the following criteria:\n\nInstructions:\n1. Determine which speaker is the **call center agent** and which is the **customer**, based on tone, speaking patterns, and context.\n2. Analyze the **customer's emotional tone** throughout the conversation (e.g., calm, angry, excited, confused, etc.).\n3. Assess whether the overall **conversation sentiment** is **positive** or **negative**.\n4. Identify the **main topic** of the conversation (e.g., complaint, sales, technical issue, billing).\n5. Extract the **most significant term** (keyword) that might indicate an important event (e.g., 'approved', 'canceled', 'offer', 'refund').\n6. Based on the overall tone and flow, classify the **general experience** as **acceptable**, **unacceptable**, or **neutral**.\n7. Summarize the **customer's experience in one word** (e.g., frustrating, smooth, unclear, excellent, disappointing).\n8. Determine whether a **sale or commitment** was made by the customer. Return as one of:\n   - \"successful\" if the customer agreed or committed to the offer\n   - \"unsuccessful\" if the customer clearly declined or rejected the offer\n   - \"not_applicable\" if the conversation is not related to a sale\n\nIf the analysis cannot be performed due to insufficient or ambiguous data, return a valid JSON object with all fields set to null and include an \"error\" field with a short explanation (5–6 words).\n\nReturn the result in only this JSON format:\n\n{\n  \"sentiment\": \"<positive|negative>\",\n  \"topic\": \"<conversation_topic>\",\n  \"significantterm\": \"<most_relevant_keyword>\",\n  \"generalvalue\": \"<acceptable|unacceptable|neutral>\",\n  \"generalexperience\": \"<one_word_summary_of_customer_experience>\",\n  \"sale_outcome\": \"<successful|unsuccessful|not_applicable>\"\n}\n\nHere is the JSON transcript to analyze:\n\n${JSON.stringify(conversation, null, 2)}\n`;\n\n// Sonucu döndür\nreturn [{ prompt }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
